Core/Jessie: You mentioned the infected get thirsty. Really thirsty.
Core/Rose: The plants drain their bodies. They need constant hydration.
Core/Jessie: So they drink… what? Water?
Core/Rose: Anything with moisture. Blood is the most effective.
Core/Jessie: That’s why they attack.
Core/Rose: Partly. It’s instinct at that point. They’re not thinking— they’re just… surviving.
Core/Jessie: Doesn’t make them any less dangerous.
Core/Rose: No. It doesn’t